      "writtenOn": "2014-07-18T10:30:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This call repeats a lot in the code. You should create a method for it like this:\n\n    def _get_connection(self, who\u003dNone, cred\u003dNone):\n\nWhere who and cred would default to self.who and self.cred.",
